  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Refugees on the Move</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Refugees on the Move projectfocuses on the current flight of people away from the collapsing new nation state of South Sudan into the three neighbouring states of Ethiopia, Sudan and Uganda. By looking at refugee movement accros countries in the region, the project is the first academic effort to systematically build a wider regional understanding of oppertunities and constrains defining the life worlds of teh refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
